Room 701840 diagnostic transcript
Recovered from the running localhost server process memory dump on 2026-07-28.

Repeated sequence:
  api: request_hechong_copy_leaf
  target: player_7
  prompt: 选择一个身份复制：1：爬行者；2：CTF；3：贤松
  api: request_hechong_copy_leaf_parse_error
  message: 未知格式

The sequence repeated continuously, which explains why the game appeared to be stuck
and why all visible pending skills remained in the pre-selection state.

Root cause:
  request_hechong_copy_leaf accepts a numeric option (1, 2, or 3), but both the
  server-side random Bot resolver and the browser UI treated it as a general role-name
  choice and submitted a role name. The CLI correctly rejected that value and retried.

Fix:
  The server Bot now parses and submits one of the numbered prompt options.
  The browser now renders those numbered options and submits their numeric value.